tools.description:
DELETE /api/v1/comments/{id}

Delete your own comment.

Deleting a thread's last remaining comment deletes the thread too.

DELETE /api/v1/lesson_activities/{id}

Delete an activity and relink the activities around it.

The activity that pointed at this one is rewired to whatever this one pointed at.

GET /api/v1/lesson_instances/{id}

Return a lesson instance in full, including grading once it's complete.

An LTI instructor may read any instance from their own course context.
